e one exhibition to see at an unhurried pace, then check the current museum page before heading over in case the schedule changes.","short_summary":"A free on-campus art stop that works well before an evening event.","evidence_claim":"The Frederick R. Weisman Museum of Art is open Tuesday through Sunday from 11 AM to 5 PM, with free admission.","source_url":"https://arts.pepperdine.edu/museum/about-weisman.htm","source_title":"About the Frederick R. Weisman Museum of Art | Pepperdine","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Current stated hours are Tuesday–Sunday, 11 AM–5 PM; it is also open until showtime on most Smothers Theatre performance days.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"firestone-fieldhouse","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Firestone Fieldhouse","title":"9. Check the home-game calendar at Firestone","subtitle":"Malibu campus • basketball and volleyball venue","notes":"Look for the next home contest, activate the student Access Pass if needed, and plan to arrive with classmates for a campus game.","short_summary":"Make a future game night part of your first-weekend plan.","evidence_claim":"Firestone Fieldhouse hosts Pepperdine men's and women's basketball home games and men's and women's volleyball home matches.","source_url":"https://pepperdinewaves.com/sports/2020/10/7/firestone-fieldhouse","source_title":"Firestone Fieldhouse | Pepperdine University Athletics","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2020-10-07","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Check the current athletics schedule and activate Pepperdine's student Access Pass before attending a home event.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"malibu-bluffs-park","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Malibu Bluffs Park","title":"10. End with a sunset-